# Pinned third-party sources for the bundled QEMU engine.
# Sourced by scripts/qemu/build.sh (POSIX shell syntax, no command substitution).
#
# Every archive is downloaded into build/cache/ and checked against the SHA-256
# below before it is used; a mismatch aborts the build. Where a hash came from
# is recorded next to each entry. All hashes were (re)computed locally on
# 2026-10-21 and matched the stated upstream source.
#
# Each source is described by <NAME>_VERSION, <NAME>_URL, <NAME>_FILE, <NAME>_SHA256.

# --- QEMU -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Latest stable release on https://download.qemu.org/ (2026-10-21).
# Hash source: upstream publishes only a detached GPG signature
# (qemu-11.1.2.tar.xz.sig). Signature verified good with Michael Roth's release
# key CEAC C9E1 5534 EBAB B82D  3FA0 3353 C9CE F108 B584; SHA-256 then computed.
QEMU_VERSION=11.1.2
QEMU_FILE=qemu-11.1.2.tar.xz
QEMU_URL=https://download.qemu.org/qemu-11.1.2.tar.xz
QEMU_SHA256=731b5681e4bb18be313231579b8efd0296c5b015fa36dc533874b639ba838016

