# build): cryptography's cp39-abi3 macOS arm64 wheel works with the Xcode
# Python 3.9.6 (cryptography 50 requires >= 3.9, != 3.9.0/3.9.1). cffi 2.0.0 is
# the newest with a cp39 wheel, pycparser 2.23 the newest for Python 3.9.
# virt-firmware's pyyaml/requests/pefile dependencies are only used by other
# subcommands (virt-fw-vars does not import them) and are not installed.
# Hash source: PyPI JSON API (https://pypi.org/pypi/<name>/<version>/json) sha256.
